---
import DemoLayout from '@/layouts/DemoLayout.astro';

import { Group, Stack, Container, Frame, Grid, Media, Layer, Heading } from 'lism-css/astro';
---

<DemoLayout title="General07">
  <Group as="section" pos="relative">
    <Layer>
      <Frame h="100%">
        <Media src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1669295384050-a1d4357bd1d7?auto=format&fit=max&w=1920&q=80" alt="" width="960" height="640" />
        <Layer bgc="black:30%" style={{ backdropFilter: 'blur(8px)' }} />
      </Frame>
    </Layer>
    <Container isWrapper="m" hasGutter pos="relative" z="1">
      <Grid gtc={['auto', null, 'auto 1fr']} c="white" g="50" py="70">
        <Heading level="2" class="u--trim" fz="3xl" fw="bold" hl="l">Enriching<br />Everyday Life</Heading>
        <Stack class="u--trimAll" g="40">
          <p>
            My role is to design complex technology so that everyone can use it intuitively and comfortably. Through repeated user interviews and
            testing, I listen thoroughly to the "voice of the user" while pursuing the best possible experience.
          </p>
          <p>
            Every project starts with observation. I visit the places where people actually work and see for myself where they hesitate and where
            their hands stop. The small stumbles you can't see on a screen alone hold the clues for improvement.
          </p>
          <p>
            Technology is only a tool for making life more convenient. That's why I value natural, gentle design that people can use without thinking
            about the controls. I will keep listening to each voice and make everyday life a little richer, step by step.
          </p>
        </Stack>
      </Grid>
    </Container>
  </Group>
</DemoLayout>
